  "notes": "Hand-finished from the provider's native create (/db/create/v2) settings. The record is the native /db/list/v2 entry with each setting added under its field id (provider _settings_record); unset settings are left blank. Permanent after create, per pkg/server/db_options.go overwriteWith: file size, maximum key and value length, maximum entries per transaction, embedded values, preallocated files and index node size. Load, unload, index flush and compaction, history truncation and settings updates are operations (operations.json). Round trip verified live on immudb 1.11.0 by tools/tests/test_ui_descriptor_roundtrip_immudb.py (2026-10-31). Create with permanent and changeable settings, reopen, update changeable settings, refused permanent change, drop."
